128. **[x] Implement Philosopher's Stone:** Treasure, $3+P: +1 Coin per 5 cards in your deck (rounded down). Validate scaling.
129. **[x] Implement Scrying Pool:** Action-Attack, $2+P: +1 Action; reveal cards until a non-Action is revealed, put the Actions into your hand, discard the rest; each other player reveals the top 2 of their deck and discards any Actions found. Validate.
130. **[x] Implement Transmute:** Action, $0+P: Trash a card from hand; gain a card per pinned text (Duchy, Action, or Gold by type). Validate type mapping.
131. **[x] Implement University:** Action, $3+P: +2 Actions; gain an Action card costing up to $5. Validate.
132. **[x] Implement Vineyard:** Victory, $2: Worth 1 VP per 3 Action cards in your deck (rounded down). Validate scoring.
133. **[x] Implement Potion the treasure:** $4, worth 1 potion; counts as a Treasure; plays into the coin/potion pool. Validate in a full buy turn.

