#### Phase 11: Cornucopia
162. **[x] Pin the official Cornucopia catalog:** Transcribe all 13 kingdom cards (plus the 5 Prizes) into src/data/cornucopia.json, correcting the roadmap's mis-stated texts (Fairgrounds is the official per-5 formula; Harvest is $5 reveal-top-4; Fortune Teller +$2 reveal-until-Victory/Curse; Hamlet +1 Action; Horse Traders set-aside Reaction; Young Witch discards 2; Tournament Duchy fallback). Validate — the pin test pins every cost/type/text and the exp catalog is kept in sync.
163. **[ ] Implement the extra-pile setup and Young Witch's Bane:** An additional kingdom pile is chosen as the Bane pile; players with a Bane card are unaffected by Young Witch's attack. Validate.
164. **[ ] Implement Fairgrounds:** Victory, $6: Worth 2 VP per 10 differently-named cards in your deck (rounded down). Validate.
