186. **[ ] Implement Fools' Gold:** Treasure-Reaction, $2: +1 Coin; if this is the first time you played a Fools' Gold this turn, +1 Coin extra; when an opponent plays an Attack, reveal this to gain a Gold if you have 5 or more in play. Validate.
187. **[ ] Implement Haggler:** Action, $5: +2 Coins; when you buy a card, gain a card costing less than it. Validate.
