189. **[ ] Implement Ill-Gotten Gains:** Treasure, $5: +1 Coin; when you play it, gain a Copper; when you gain it, each other player gains a Curse. Validate.
190. **[ ] Implement Inn:** Action, $5: +2 Cards; +2 Actions; when you gain this, look through your discard pile and shuffle any number of them into your deck. Validate.
191. **[ ] Implement Jack of All Trades:** Action, $4: +1 Card; +1 Action; gain a Silver; look at the top card, discard it or topdeck it; trash a non-Victory card from hand. Validate the multi-step order.
