196. **[ ] Implement Oasis:** Action, $3: +1 Card; +1 Action; +1 Coin; discard a card. Validate.
197. **[ ] Implement Oracle:** Action-Attack, $3: +1 Action; each player reveals the top 2 of their deck; you choose one to discard, then they topdeck the other (you draw 2 if you discard yours). Validate.
198. **[ ] Implement Scheme:** Action, $3: +1 Card; +1 Action; at the start of Cleanup you may topdeck an Action from play. Validate the cleanup hook.
199. **[ ] Implement Silk Road:** Victory, $4: Worth 1 VP per 4 Victory cards in your deck (rounded down). Validate.
200. **[ ] Implement Spice Merchant:** Action, $4: +1 Card; +1 Action; trash a Treasure from hand; +2 Coins and +2 Cards, or +2 Buys. Validate both choices.
201. **[ ] Implement Stables:** Action, $5: Discard a Treasure from hand; +3 Cards; or reveal a hand with no Treasure. Validate.
202. **[ ] Implement Trader:** Action-Reaction, $4: Trash a card from hand; gain a Silver; when an opponent plays an Attack, reveal this to gain a Silver instead of being affected. Validate.
