#### Phase 23: Online Multiplayer (server-plugin)
445. **[ ] Server rooms and lobby:** createServerSocket rooms with 2–6 seats, room codes, host/join flows, and room status tracking. Validate in two browser tabs.
446. **[ ] Authoritative turn gating:** The server accepts move payloads only from the on-turn player (turn counter + event sequence), rejecting out-of-turn, stale and malformed moves. Validate with tampered payloads.
447. **[ ] Full-state snapshot sync:** Serialize the complete game state to the durable snapshot (versioned), broadcast to the room, and apply on both clients. Validate a multi-turn online game stays in sync.
448. **[ ] Reconnect and resync:** A rejoining player fetches the latest snapshot; mid-game joins are rejected or spectator-gated. Validate.
449. **[ ] Rematch, resign, forfeit and draw:** Winner/reason recording per room; the rematch flips first-player. Validate all flows.
450. **[ ] Room chat:** Chat with profanity filter, per-connection and per-network-group rate limits, message length caps. Validate.
451. **[ ] Presence:** Online counters, disconnect detection, opponent-away states, claim-win on opponent absence. Validate.
452. **[ ] Leaderboard:** Top scores in durable bytes with name entry, validation and rate limits. Validate.
453. **[ ] Security pass:** The server script holds no secrets; every rpc input is type- and length-validated; payload and room-count limits enforced. Validate against the skill's checklist.
454. **[ ] Online lobby UI and full smoke test:** Lobby integrated with setup, plus a complete 2-player online game from setup to scoring over the network. Validate.

