#### Phase 25: Polish & Release
466. **[ ] Full rules audit:** Compare every implemented card's effect, cost and type against the official text and fix all discrepancies. Validate with a cross-reference report.
467. **[ ] Performance pass:** 6-player long games with 500+ card events stay smooth; virtualize hand/supply rendering if needed. Validate with a stress game.
468. **[ ] Accessibility:** Keyboard navigation, ARIA labels on cards/buttons, focus management, contrast, and prefers-reduced-motion. Validate with an a11y walkthrough.
469. **[ ] Audio:** WebAudio SFX for draw/play/buy/trash/win plus an optional music toggle, default off. Validate.
470. **[ ] Export and share:** Game-log JSON export, seeded kingdom share URLs, end-game stat screen. Validate.
471. **[ ] Public meta:** $meta image/social card, favicon/emblem, clean console and no perchanceErrors on load. Validate.
472. **[ ] Tutorial and sample kingdoms:** Guided first turn and a 'First Game' recommended 10-card kingdom (base set only). Validate.
473. **[ ] Release sign-off:** Full test suite green, final visual check with the vision tool, and every roadmap box ticked. Validate.
